model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 R14 (#198): EUR's and PLN's readings both at 2026-02-15 end. Item 74, gap and last there are RUN-DOMAIN, naming the two units (g, l); item 73, since reads the instant only (sn: 1); no-item 2, the register's anchor entry of an EUR read is EUR's (an); no-item 6, a law read of the reading refuses, the file loads (lw); item 76, low names no unit and is refused, its spelled-out definition answers (lo, lmin)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor broker
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask g: gap(broker, 2026-02-15)
ask sn: since(stated[broker], 2026-02-16)
ask an: bal(broker, EUR, 2026-02-20)
ask lo: low(broker, 2026-02-10 .. 2026-02-20)
ask lmin: min(bal(broker, EUR, d) for d in 2026-02-10 .. 2026-02-20 step 1 day)
